{"job_id":"F-35b66dd721222cca3a01","family_id":"F-35b66dd721222cca3a01","title":"등기특별회계법","prior_queue_status":"QUEUED","language":"zh","rows":[{"id":"B1-zh-00001","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":7,"target_id":"d37090cdf04b28cadfe7cff86fd15f632d65aa895d75b787afc1364672544867","source_hash":"eb344f17aa8f68af2fda0417f33250c4f1b92ed06b1d73db5d31eeb8ce54db85","text":"特别会计法登记法"},{"id":"B1-zh-00002","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":0,"end":99,"target_id":"60f7ed79d0cfd618e15f5e4bd35b430368f1f4c40b2081882d8f05170cde6ed6","source_hash":"6618c1343454c9b790beb97c963007bf14af002cfa2d16dbd7225117ffac8ddb","text":"第一条（目的）本法的目的是设立登记特别账户（以下简称“账户”），以确保登记事务的合理有效运作，并以其收入弥补其支出。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00003","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":99,"end":126,"target_id":"5542fa9b77e82b92e5140512909a6d88fbf5f316ccda2e68849d57c0bdaaa096","source_hash":"438e5dfe6698e84bbff2aa3e747282de0ee643faba013ae0ba72807cc88f71d6","text":"第二条（管理）本会计由最高法院首席大法官管理。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00004","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":126,"end":524,"target_id":"9f8b8414f6f99a195db511bd7fd26d754e102ee5d71a57a2c8772687fd70f063","source_hash":"a60662e3e8d34851f15cde4316c7b2d6fd5591bdaefb9800f54925b5b54e825c","text":"第三条（收入和支出）\n① 该账户的收入如下：<1996年12月12日、2006年5月10日、2006年12月30日修订>\n尽管《国有财产管理特别账户法》第6条有相关规定，但根据《国有财产法》第30条的规定，已废止使用的登记机关的土地和设施的出售所得款项\n2. 与注册业务相关的收入\n3. 上年结转\n4. 根据《公共基金管理基金法》从公共基金管理基金存入的款项\n5. 借款\n6. 其他收入\n② 会计支出如下：<2006年5月10日修订>\n尽管《国有财产管理特别账户法》第六条另有规定，但设立和管理登记机构的费用仍属于此类。\n2. 注册工作相关费用\n3. 偿还借款、存款及利息\n3-2. 转账、存款或向其他账户或资金捐款\n4. 此项会计业务运营所需的其他费用\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00005","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":524,"end":666,"target_id":"8561ffbb587bfe046624135ceab77148c79a1cc31a4d39c5cb3a938b274918b7","source_hash":"c61fc22b5b8fa26969da31f4abc73f54bffbd7e35fdad672a5919d4aaabd4532","text":"第三条之二（登记业务小额收费收入的特别规定）\n① 与注册服务相关的少量费用可以通过注册税票、电子货币或电子支付等方式收取。\n② 第1款规定小额费用的范围、收取方式和收取程序，应当按照最高人民法院的规定执行。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00006","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":666,"end":774,"target_id":"a06ee18fcd7367174f497e03423eb50bbc14dc736d9dcada81f9ad12bbab15f7","source_hash":"748d5bfaac2b3d2fee655ffb5db3d2e521d6fb5b89357a64edbca7665f1cdd10","text":"第4条（借款）\n① 为支付本账户项下的费用，必要时可从本账户借款。\n② 根据第1款规定进行的临时借款，应当用相关年度的收入偿还。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00007","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":774,"end":889,"target_id":"fffa2e1f4fb04404853cfd9d3399347c8ea1bdd9dad015dd60197669fd5c9b94","source_hash":"9485a85e428afb3bf7a7729af4f72a9f699d2043ecedd81769cb0a02b535fe07","text":"第五条（盈余的处理）  本会计年度结算时如有盈余，应结转至下一年度的收入。但如有必要，可将部分盈余转入一般账户。<2006年5月10日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00008","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":889,"end":957,"target_id":"0700964219fc5d43c179347ded40b75c9688e4da690f9407c4bcd55c8d889751","source_hash":"1e7633481aea4270903f0022d09f31e9634dfaa6c6e0e2aa1a6527b9b95679fc","text":"第六条（储备基金）本账户可拨出储备基金，用于弥补预算外的意外支出或超出预算的支出。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00009","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":957,"end":1084,"target_id":"fe281f7ecc4987a3f29031e99f82bd0df22d286e05b983fbf1a3ec8ce34b44f7","source_hash":"762ea96b2023498ba8dab7c5dcf48157b4b4b8de6a89a04bc301a0d2c966c804","text":"第六条之二（关于赔偿支付的特别规定）  凡因本账户所涉登记业务而产生国家赔偿法规定的赔偿责任的，赔偿金不由本账户承担，而由国家一般账户承担。<2006年5月10日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00010","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1084,"end":1129,"target_id":"8f09f492c634faddb4063a0d47f267455dfaf43cf09d9d3178f48e53f6c16426","source_hash":"dfa2001574dde625f5438e1097cd1dca369cf25569c500ec6c68868233b2af42","text":"第七条（执行规则） 执行本法所必需的事项，由最高法院规则规定。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00011","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1129,"end":1265,"target_id":"616e4292b33167e27907b30c0b6eb158db2f023dcfbb989ec1608d811ac86599","source_hash":"1a2ab17c572f4e10f56bf3b56245a93820e01e65e4014f35611c179ad0c3cd3d","text":"补充规定 <第4549号，1993年6月11日>\n\n①（生效日期）本法自1994年1月1日起生效。\n\n②（适用期限）本法自1994财政年度起至2027财政年度止适用。<2003年11月25日、2010年6月10日、2017年9月19日修订>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00012","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1265,"end":1314,"target_id":"c13bb54496fc3e0110c947e9f15fcd7ce6cb7dcfb9511cc4ae5d78f2e207ea66","source_hash":"c774cd1bde13c4cc37ab5e27bebc9290d13ad1190cd825af20d97d5a4698bb89","text":"补充规定 <第5006号，1995年12月6日>\n\n本法自1996年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00013","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1314,"end":1349,"target_id":"1b24a328fa11a20c8d946cddcbe441f09e30a320a4431c11c2f1830ee7fcd8cc","source_hash":"0077e705d3f4cdd98e12634eb2839a2086f255e4f53e3ffe50f3d323f58063d9","text":"附录（金融贷款特别账户法）<第5170号法案，1996年12月12日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00014","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1349,"end":1385,"target_id":"6c9e3a499df9c7ecce30388bcc2f912e9dfe85628c0a725f8b11abd08de1b4f9","source_hash":"07d681b02400b495cc6cca7e3ac2639ec4987ba878b88dfe7983033da0dbe9f8","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自1997年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00015","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1385,"end":1400,"target_id":"f549e169a1a49fdb7144d501403fed2a94f257751e7fcefcfd506f4069ff89fa","source_hash":"119c19aa8cf5d20a95854f948299b43b564b2b8788981249c71d35dec8490177","text":"省略第 2 至 4 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00016","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1400,"end":1501,"target_id":"4d0c0d5d21b7ebccc869ae8abd0c72194ffbc7bd2d156e00c45e209d824bec0f","source_hash":"43c730097b794e09a71de3b08485cb81643bd4f864eb87a60b858fb9696d9483","text":"第五条（其他法律的修正）①至⑬ 已省略\n\n  ⑭ 《登记特别账户法》修订如下。\n\n  第三条第一款第四项中的“财政投资和贷款专项账户”应改为“财政贷款专项账户”。\n\n  ⑮省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00017","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1501,"end":1509,"target_id":"0bf1b426fbe775ecad9f614a38292beaf39097ccbdb659a108d1753add629b13","source_hash":"9b7ba4db40f54bc0237c77df55ff37ba785c3eedd3e841d5beefb1bf8efd6bb2","text":"第 6 条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00018","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1509,"end":1553,"target_id":"c951d5d07758a1fb7347f302620b2bc190427c9eb43d1cb5b42a00186c8dd75c","source_hash":"f26803e473c989cd8f0fa96f145ab506656f633c2ba915ebf67460f810a61cf1","text":"补充规定 <第6989号，2003年11月25日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00019","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1553,"end":1596,"target_id":"0f26c7873efecf269ef789b94d1c0e36ebbe11c7dc06a6a935ba2126408694ff","source_hash":"deda005915b57a319a236ea6318967887b94016bb7aa1cd0b8f20364ae1d38b0","text":"补充规定 <第7953号，2006年5月10日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00020","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1596,"end":1631,"target_id":"1c6c34345ae8157e90dac632a8ea8313ce8d9af4e33ca7866990031fd059ecb8","source_hash":"11a22912b783a0809116a09a5c71c238fd698da82ad466645a366aa5f885a954","text":"增补（公共资金管理基金法）<第8135号法案，2006年12月30日>\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00021","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1631,"end":1667,"target_id":"a82b2f24fec3d983e07603bb8ec11d1e13a49125452ecdf965266d45d96e40d4","source_hash":"2c468708166c2d4d8bb7ead1039898c55981fa09b74315bc01edfc0bb6cc6e1a","text":"第一条（生效日期）本法自2007年1月1日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00022","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1667,"end":1682,"target_id":"0241fbd85da1d3ffac196b6b5219d1f9bdde59708745893c050465d9c42fe4bb","source_hash":"83d7e2617f4bf3ca8b29241abcde12e5b43dc5f987d1316993039fbd766a366d","text":"省略第 2 至 7 条\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00023","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1682,"end":1817,"target_id":"6298729501f298ca5584a6c10ec3a05432e2b631ef868fb7dd7ba59aa9fd8592","source_hash":"f09946aa8824091fdf3529c02b4eec6f5cac60ef175eb04d3a14d4bc01a7df88","text":"第八条（修改其他法律）①至⑧ 已省略\n\n  ⑨ 《登记特别账户法》部分修订如下。\n\n  第三条第一款第四项规定如下。\n\n    4. 根据《公共基金管理基金法》从公共基金管理基金存入的款项\n\n  ⑩ 至 <17> 已省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00024","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1817,"end":1825,"target_id":"35bd37629fde9d67e52863acfea7377b52f9a4fbab8ab8c8565f39d5c921fbce","source_hash":"1da8ec1baef9be415ada7d35b269bd946545d2e64a474889ab52758d3384f723","text":"第9条省略\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00025","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1825,"end":1869,"target_id":"df9c8d0d05fdf7d67d24ee2739ec871c38da58fbfa485c209f2b5abe8bb13e4b","source_hash":"eb42f4f78cbd2e476e1e32408f742bc19e85ee9ef662639592638d4ac08508c5","text":"补充规定 <第10365号，2010年6月10日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。\n\n"},{"id":"B1-zh-00026","doc":"B1","law_id":"kr-001179-197503-ko","scope":"BODY","start":1869,"end":1911,"target_id":"1e76c4215cf68ee0b0136a9820269b430cfddc45429baae1c3d45f469c400a07","source_hash":"94f4c094b826bb1aea07dfb8279d994b9717ce88e44605d1ea43af92f1148b9e","text":"补充规定 <第14875号，2017年9月19日>\n\n本法自公布之日起生效。"}]}